  "description": "To get your grubby hands on some Titanium, §aRutile§r must first be reduced to §aTitanium Tetrachloride§r in an §3HV Chemical Reactor§r, then reduced again in an §3EBF§r with §dMagnesium§r to finally arrive at Titanium.

